vboard (2.8.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * add Apple macOS Dark and Apple macOS Light keyboard themes with two-tone keycaps
    and Apple Keyboard Viewer orange accent highlights for AltGr keys
  * add responsive font, key, header, and suggestion scaling across all themes
  * add python-evdev uinput fallback backend and 250ms stuck-key watchdog with crash/hide release
  * add Arabic (ar) layout with AR short label, XKB sync, and Hunspell charset support
  * add 4-tab Customize Vboard dialog inspired by macOS Accessibility Keyboard:
    accent color, font scale, corner radius, key spacing, optional Media/System row,
    Current Text preview bar, Press/Release activation, Sticky Modifier double-tap lock,
    Auto-Capitalize, Auto-Space, Hover Dwell typing, and Inactivity Fade

 -- Aleksander Kutycki <74899889+olekkut@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:50:00 +0000

vboard (2.7.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * use /usr/bin/python3 shebang and dh_python3 so virtualenvs/pyenv never break GI/uinput imports
  * fix corrupted StatusNotifierItem DBUS_MENU_XML, GetGroupProperties tuple format, and layout submenu
  * fix Start Minimized and collapsed headerbar state on startup and Hide/Show toggle
  * harden install-kwin-rule.sh (create missing ~/.config, KConfig formatting, preserve saved position)
  * harden setup-uinput.sh to always install udev/modules-load rules and handle containers/built-in uinput
  * detect Hunspell dictionary charset from sibling .aff SET directive (ISO8859-2 Polish, KOI8-R Russian)
  * fix key-repeat GLib-CRITICAL source removal, Gdk.Keymap deprecation, opacity formatting, and settings fallbacks

 -- Aleksander Kutycki <74899889+olekkut@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:40:00 +0000

